OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will begin cloudy with
OL,6,Fthe chance of an odd shower across
OL,7,FShetland. Bright or sunny spells will
OL,8,Fincrease across Orkney from late
OL,9,Fmorning before spreading to Shetland
OL,10,Fin the late afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will be cloudy at
OL,13,Ftimes but will stay dry. The night
OL,14,Fwill continue dry with clear periods
OL,15,Fincreasing later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FThe morning will begin dry and
OL,18,Fbright but thickening cloud and patchy
OL,19,Frain will spread east from mid-morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
