OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy rain turning dry and
OL,7,Fbrighter later Saturday. Sunday will
OL,8,Fcontinue dry with sunny spells but
OL,9,Fcloud and further rain spreads east
OL,10,FMonday.
